{"id":"ellas","lemma":"ellas","pos":"pron","rank":549,"glosses":["they, them (used subjectively and after prepositions; can refer to women and feminine nouns)"],"ipa":"/ˈeʝas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ellas.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ellas están de vuelta.","en":"They're back.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439222"},{"text":"Ellas van a irse.","en":"They're going.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/412243"},{"text":"Ellas odiaban a Tom.","en":"They hated Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44133"},{"text":"Me acuerdo de ellas.","en":"I remember them.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441818"},{"text":"Ellas ayudaron a Tom.","en":"They helped Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799626"}]}